id: pm-starter-cz6b
title: Certify pm-starter with published PM CLI SDK 2026.9.29
description: "The published agent starter still exact-pins CLI SDK, pm-ops and pm-changelog 2026.9.23. Upgrade to the latest published compatible releases, keep the canonical merge-driver launcher aligned, test the package gate and packed npm/Bun use, and record exact-head review/privacy limits."
type: Task
status: blocked
priority: 1
tags[3]: agent-starter,"area:quality","area:toolchain"
created_at: "2026-09-29T14:48:42.416Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T22:25:30.707Z"
author: codex
estimated_minutes: 150
acceptance_criteria: "CLI SDK exact-pins 2026.9.29 and release helpers pin their latest published compatible versions; lockfile and merge-driver launcher match published artifacts; direct and PM-linked release gate pass with exact totals, no skipped tests and explicit coverage scope; fresh packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx acceptance runs on CLI 2026.9.29; strict PM health and GitHub checks pass; public history privacy and substantive bot review blockers stay explicit before merge or publication."
risk: medium
confidence: high
